1. Project Overview

CampusFindU is a campus-wide Lost and Found Management System where students, faculty, staff, and visitors can report lost or found items, pin their locations on an interactive map, search for items, submit ownership claims, and receive notifications.

Administrators manage reports, users, claims, and the overall system.

