12. MVP vs Advanced Features

To keep your project manageable, I recommend separating your features.

🟢 MVP — Must Have
User registration/login
User roles
Report lost item
Report found item
Upload photos
Interactive map/pin locations
Search/filter
Item details
Claim system
Admin verification
🔵 Advanced / Defining Features
Smart Match Suggestions
Location-based matching
Real-time notifications
Admin analytics/dashboard

This is important because you don't want to spend all your development time building AI before the basic Lost & Found system works.

